1
00:00:02,501 --> 00:00:03,971
(Raj:)You're wrong.
No, I'm not.

2
00:00:03,971 --> 00:00:06,241
(Raj:)Yes, you are.
No, I'm not.

3
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:08,240
(Howard:)Settle this. Those
little animated pictures

4
00:00:08,242 --> 00:00:11,012
(Howard:)on the Internet, are they
called "gifs" or "jifs"?

5
00:00:11,012 --> 00:00:12,412
(Leonard:)Well, the G stands
for "graphics."

6
00:00:12,413 --> 00:00:14,413
(Leonard:)That's a hard G,
so I'd say "gif."

7
00:00:14,415 --> 00:00:17,345
W... The guy who invented
it says it's "jif."

8
00:00:17,351 --> 00:00:20,921
(Howard:)I'm sorry, do you mean
the guy or the juy?

9
00:00:21,921 --> 00:00:24,161
(Sheldon:)Well, I'll give you
three guesses

10
00:00:24,158 --> 00:00:26,088
(Sheldon:)why I'm so irritated.

11
00:00:26,093 --> 00:00:29,733
(Howard:)Something happened different
from the way you wanted it.

12
00:00:30,697 --> 00:00:32,697
(Sheldon:)I guess news travels fast.

13
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,700
(Sheldon:)It's true,
a select group of scientists

14
00:00:35,703 --> 00:00:37,273
(Sheldon:)was invited
to a weekend symposium

15
00:00:37,271 --> 00:00:39,101
(Sheldon:)at a former home
of Richard Feynman,

16
00:00:39,106 --> 00:00:40,806
(Sheldon:)and I wasn't included.

17
00:00:40,808 --> 00:00:43,538
(Leonard:)Oh, Sheldon, I'm sure it's
not because they don't think

18
00:00:43,544 --> 00:00:45,314
(Leonard:)you're an elite
scientist.
Yeah,

19
00:00:45,312 --> 00:00:48,952
(Howard:)I bet you anything it's
just 'cause you're
a pain in the ass.

20
00:00:48,949 --> 00:00:52,189
(Sheldon:)You're just saying that
to make me feel better.

21
00:00:53,219 --> 00:00:55,219
(Leonard:)Look, you can spend
the rest of the day

22
00:00:55,222 --> 00:00:57,992
(Leonard:)being bitter about this.
Agreed.

23
00:00:57,992 --> 00:01:01,162
I was gonna say "or,"
but why bother?

